      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "Refugees are mapped to the chaotic street scene",
      "description": "The text 'the media calls them refugees' explicitly labels the people in the image as 'refugees'. The visual material, a chaotic street scene with burning tires and people in motion, is then mapped onto this label, implying that refugees are inherently associated with such disorder and violence. This is a hateful stereotype that equates the group with the depicted chaos.",
