      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the text chunk 'the media calls them refugees but this is what you will get' because the phrase 'this is what you will get' directly addresses the viewer ('you'), implying that the user is the recipient of the consequence or outcome being described. This creates a direct semiotic projection where the user is positioned as the one who will experience or witness the chaos depicted, thereby internalizing the meme's hateful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
